{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.yekutieli_levi_unification","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.yekutieli_levi_unification","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.NoZeroSMulDivisors.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_obstruction_iff_localCohom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_obstruction_iff_localCohom","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_levi_unification.lean#L71-L79","doc":"With nontrivial linking, the leading obstruction is nonzero **iff** the local\ncohomology at `p` is nonzero. Derived from `kappa_def`, `smul_ne_zero_iff` and\nstep (c)/(e). Says nothing about the Levi form or about regularity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.eulerResidue_iff_localCohom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.eulerResidue_iff_localCohom","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_levi_unification.lean#L67-L67","doc":"**Steps (c)/(e):** the Euler residue is nonzero ⟺ the local cohomology at\n`p` is nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.localCohomNonzero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.localCohomNonzero","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_levi_unification.lean#L64-L64","doc":"\"`H¹_{𝔪_p}(A) ≠ 0`\": the local cohomology at `p` is nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.kappa_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.kappa_def","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_levi_unification.lean#L62-L62","doc":"**Step (e):** the leading obstruction is the linking multiple of the\nEuler residue. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.kappaLeading","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.kappaLeading","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_levi_unification.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The leading obstruction `κ_n|_Σ = lk · e(ξ)|_Σ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.linking","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.linking","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_levi_unification.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The linking number `lk(ϱ₁, ϱ₂)` of the anti-parallel pair. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.eulerResidue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.eulerResidue","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_levi_unification.lean#L55-L55","doc":"The Euler residue `e(ξ)|_Σ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_levi_unification.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NSObstructionLeviData","kind":"class","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_levi_unification.lean#L46-L67","doc":"Local-cohomology / Euler-residue data at a collision point `p ∈ Σ`, from\n`ns-obstruction-tower` steps (c) and (e). Step (d), the Levi equivalence, is\nwithdrawn (see the module docstring).\n\n`M` is the coefficient group (torsion-free); `linking : ℤ` is\n`lk(ϱ₁, ϱ₂)`; the leading obstruction is `kappaLeading = linking • eulerResidue`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}